WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.090
- This one kid in my
sixth grade math class

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:03.498
called me pit stain,

00:00:03.498 --> 00:00:06.506
but then I bullied him back really hard,

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.149
and I regret that to this day.

00:00:08.149 --> 00:00:09.063
- [Female Host] Is there anything

00:00:09.063 --> 00:00:10.579
you were teased or bullied about,

00:00:10.579 --> 00:00:12.745
like a name you were
called that stuck with you?

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:14.942
- I won't say who called me
it, because it was so long ago,

00:00:14.942 --> 00:00:17.417
but I remember being called this a lot.

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:18.462
- Classic!

00:00:18.462 --> 00:00:19.945
- Classic.

00:00:19.945 --> 00:00:22.110
- Which, by the way, is not a bad thing.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:23.293
- So, did people make fun of your laugh?

00:00:23.293 --> 00:00:25.065
- Oh my God, I've been
in the middle of shows,

00:00:25.065 --> 00:00:26.462
and people have turned to me

00:00:26.462 --> 00:00:28.030
and been like, "You
have a terrible laugh."

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:29.268
- Well, I'm always being teased

00:00:29.268 --> 00:00:31.518
for my big teeth, or my eyebrows,

00:00:31.518 --> 00:00:33.203
or anything it is, on social media.

00:00:33.203 --> 00:00:34.301
- Your eyebrows?

00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:35.102
- Yes.

00:00:35.102 --> 00:00:36.779
- I was just gonna say,
your eyebrows are so great!

00:00:36.779 --> 00:00:37.765
- Well, thank you.

00:00:37.765 --> 00:00:38.606
- When I was a kid,

00:00:38.606 --> 00:00:41.299
kids would kinda tease me a
little bit about acting stuff.

00:00:41.299 --> 00:00:42.836
- Even when you're J-Lo's son?

00:00:42.836 --> 00:00:44.745
- Well, that's what they
would tease me for, you know.

00:00:44.745 --> 00:00:45.705
Kids are mean.

00:00:45.705 --> 00:00:47.529
- When I was younger, I was
a huge tomboy, I still am,

00:00:47.529 --> 00:00:48.766
and people used to tease me about that.

00:00:48.766 --> 00:00:49.415
- Yeah.

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:50.696
- I have really long hair,

00:00:50.696 --> 00:00:51.860
and I've had long hair my whole life,

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:53.054
so people would tease me with that.

00:00:53.054 --> 00:00:53.854
- Really?

00:00:53.854 --> 00:00:54.420
- Yeah!

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.020
- You know, I was teased
a lot about being short,

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:57.918
and my hair, and like all this stuff.

00:00:57.918 --> 00:01:00.393
- I'm right there with you
on the short one, by the way.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.776
All the time I got called short.

00:01:02.776 --> 00:01:04.745
Is there any advice you'd give to someone

00:01:04.745 --> 00:01:06.302
who's being teased or bullied?

00:01:06.302 --> 00:01:09.085
- I encourage everyone
that, you know, feels alone,

00:01:09.085 --> 00:01:10.878
to go online and find friends.

00:01:10.878 --> 00:01:11.892
Hey, that's how we got together!

00:01:11.892 --> 00:01:12.744
- Yay!

00:01:12.744 --> 00:01:14.025
- What's for you, is what's for you.

00:01:14.025 --> 00:01:16.926
So, what you got going on,
you make sure you own it.

00:01:16.926 --> 00:01:19.572
- If you find an activity
that you love to do,

00:01:19.572 --> 00:01:22.313
and you have people that
are like-minded like you,

00:01:22.313 --> 00:01:23.977
you'll find your friend
and your support system.

00:01:23.977 --> 00:01:25.182
- As you grow older, you realize that

00:01:25.182 --> 00:01:27.006
all the things you think
weren't cool about you,

00:01:27.006 --> 00:01:30.568
are what make you stick
out later in a good way.

00:01:30.568 --> 00:01:32.285
- All hate comes from some kind of love.

00:01:32.285 --> 00:01:34.441
- Roll off your back,
laugh with 'em, and--

00:01:34.441 --> 00:01:35.422
- And become a superhero!

00:01:35.422 --> 00:01:36.148
- That's right.

00:01:36.148 --> 00:01:37.022
- Tell an adult.

00:01:37.022 --> 00:01:39.262
I think that's number one,
that people never want to do.

00:01:39.262 --> 00:01:40.564
- You have to speak up.

00:01:40.564 --> 00:01:41.737
It's very important,

00:01:41.737 --> 00:01:42.953
because these days and times,

00:01:42.953 --> 00:01:44.905
know that the action can be taken care of.

00:01:44.905 --> 00:01:46.579
- They're doing it for other reasons

00:01:46.579 --> 00:01:49.373
other than the fact that
you're weaker than them.

00:01:49.373 --> 00:01:50.153
It's really sad.

00:01:50.153 --> 00:01:51.166
- That person has been

00:01:51.166 --> 00:01:53.097
taught that behavior in their home life,

00:01:53.097 --> 00:01:54.740
so they are probably
being teased and bullied

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:56.692
by the adults that surround them.

00:01:56.692 --> 00:01:58.804
And that's not gonna
make you feel any better,

00:01:58.804 --> 00:02:01.545
it's just kinda a way of
practicing compassion,

00:02:01.545 --> 00:02:02.568
so that you don't interpret it

00:02:02.568 --> 00:02:04.617
as something that's
specifically happening to you.

00:02:04.617 --> 00:02:06.057
- So, all the people
who called me a tomboy,

00:02:06.057 --> 00:02:07.646
I wanna say, you're totally right.

00:02:07.646 --> 00:02:09.353
I still am and I'm so proud of it.

00:02:09.353 --> 00:02:10.429
- I am extra!

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:11.689
I'm so extra.

00:02:11.689 --> 00:02:13.396
I'm over-the-top and I'm loud,

00:02:13.396 --> 00:02:16.158
and I would rather be too
big than be too small.

00:02:16.158 --> 00:02:19.732
- We all know that monkeys
are known for climbing things.

00:02:19.732 --> 00:02:22.942
So, look at me now, I'm climbing
my way to the top, dammit.

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:25.193
- I started from the bottom, now I'm here.

00:02:25.193 --> 00:02:26.665
- Oh!

00:02:26.665 --> 00:02:30.606
(upbeat music)

00:02:32.496 --> 00:02:33.752
(squeaking)

